        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/26/leaker-says-iphone-ultra-will-come-in-these-colors-with-one-surprise/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/03/iphone-fold-mockup-red.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Leaker Evan Blass has <a href=\"https://x.com/_evanblass_/status/2092673526612332614?s=61&amp;t=a-bloX1n-TZ50ofqhetO1A\">just posted</a> what he claims are the three colors coming to iPhone Ultra, and they include a surprising red option.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Update</strong>: Mark Gurman <a href=\"https://x.com/markgurman/status/2092695626383602176?s=61&amp;t=a-bloX1n-TZ50ofqhetO1A\">posted on X</a> that there’s no red option coming for iPhone Ultra, directly disputing Blass’s claim. Original article below.</p>",
