        "title": "OpenAI restores 5-hour Codex and Work limits for ChatGPT Plus users",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/24/openai-restores-5-hour-codex-and-work-limits-for-chatgpt-plus-users/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/chatgpt-red.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following several weeks during which ChatGPT users were subject only to a weekly usage cap, OpenAI announced today that it is restoring a five-hour limit on Codex and ChatGPT Work for Plus subscribers. Here are the details.</p>",
