        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.breakingcatnews.com/comic/everything-is-broken/\">Breaking Cat News</a> is a completed webcomic by <a href=\"https://www.breakingcatnews.com/about-breaking-cat-news-2/about-georgia-dunn/\">Georgia Dunn</a>. Georgia's cats report on the latest happenings from the studio and live on the ground. <a href=\"https://www.breakingcatnews.com/comic/the-trees-are-falling-apart/\">Trees</a> falling apart! A <a href=\"https://www.breakingcatnews.com/comic/the-woman-is-in-a-room-we-cant-get-into/\">door</a> is closed! <a href=\"https://www.breakingcatnews.com/comic/everything-is-broken/\">Everything</a> is broken! After a successful web run, Breaking Cat News <a href=\"https://www.gocomics.com/breaking-cat-news\">made it to the newspapers</a>. Although <a href=\"https://www.dailycartoonist.com/index.php/2024/02/24/the-real-gannett-conspiracy-chauvinism/\">2024 was not kind</a> (<a href=\"https://www.metafilter.com/202800/There-are-more-dead-men-than-living-women-in-the-funny-pages\">previously</a>). <a href=\"https://www.breakingcatnews.com/about-breaking-cat-news-2/photos-of-the-real-elvis-puck-and-lupin-and-the-people-too/\">Cat tax</a>.",
