        "content_text": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?fit=1024%2C768&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"two-panel collage image of author Wilbert L. Cooper on left and book cover image on right that reads &quot;The Black Shield: An American Memoir of Family and Power&quot;\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?w=2400&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=300%2C225&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=1024%2C768&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=1536%2C1152&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=2048%2C1536&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=1200%2C900&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=800%2C600&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=600%2C450&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=400%2C300&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=200%2C150&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=2000%2C1500&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=780%2C585&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?resize=706%2C530&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?w=2340&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Will-Cooper-The-Black-Shield.jpg?fit=1024%2C768&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>Both of Wilbert L. Cooper's parents were cops. In this excerpt from his memoir, Cooper recounts how his mother got into the force—and what the department did to try to keep her out.",
