        "title": "Apple announces price increase for Apple TV and Apple One subscriptions",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/28/apple-announces-price-increase-for-apple-tv-and-apple-one-subscriptions/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/apple-tv-sunset-mountains.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Just <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/17/apple-raises-prices-for-apple-music-and-apple-one-subscriptions/\">weeks after announcing</a> price increases for Apple Music, Apple today announced that Apple TV is also getting more expensive. The company confirmed to <em>9to5Mac </em>that the price of Apple TV is increasing from $12.99 to $14.99 per month. </p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Individual tier of Apple One is also getting more expensive. </p>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
